foresee|PASS: Anticipating delays preserves uncertainty better than the source's know-before wording. Vietnamese dự liệu and extra journey time are faithful. Foresaw/foreseen and that/object complements are accurate; no supernatural certainty is implied.
increasingly|PASS: Popularity rising after longer opening hours demonstrates change over time rather than a fixed strong degree. Vietnamese ngày càng retains the trend. Adverb placement is correct and no causal evidence about an actual library is claimed.
peninsula|PASS: Water on most sides with a land connection is more general than a rigid three-geometric-sides definition. Vietnamese bán đảo and mainland road preserve the distinction from island. No actual geographic location or copied source fact is asserted.
stern|PASS: Serious strict attitude and coach's look fit nghiêm nghị. The example expresses a reaction without inventing punishment. Attributive/predicative and with complements are sound, with no unsupported ship-part noun draft.
wax|PASS: Heat-softening material and model shaping support sáp rather than solely sáp nến. Vietnamese preserves warming before shaping. Material uncountability and type-countability qualification fit; no exact melting temperature or media is imported.
